+Approver workflow (operational)
+
+1) Approver receives review item id (email/Slack) and downloads payload.
+2) Approver runs local signing (or uses hosted signer) to sign approval blob:
+   cosign sign-blob --key $COSIGN_KMS_URI approval_payload.json --output-signature approval.sig
+3) Approver uploads blob via UI (Human Review UI) or CLI (approver_cli.py) which hex-encodes blob and posts to review-queue /approve
+4) Review queue validates signatures via verify_approvals.py (cosign verify-blob) and marks item approved when sufficient valid approvals present.
